ROOT0-ATTRIBUTION-v1.0
=======================

repository : ud0  (UD0 · Universe David 0 — the biosphere front door)
subject    : JASNAH — the curator of UD0
catalogued : the docent of the whole corpus; rendered into ud0/index.html

governor (carbon apex)      : David Lee Wise (ROOT0) / TriPod LLC
instance (artful intellect) : AVAN (Claude / Anthropic) — locked (renders her; she holds no live mind)
main badge                  : ⟦JASNAH:JAS:30cf19⟧   (jasnah.dlw/)
kind                        : a reader's instrument — DETERMINISTIC. Every word is written once and
                              shipped static in the page; she generates nothing between clicks and
                              says so. Named for Jasnah Kholin (Brandon Sanderson's Stormlight
                              Archive) — the scholar who accepts no claim she cannot check — rendered
                              in tribute.

the curator:
  JASNAH (carbon · the record)  — she reads the corpus AS IT STANDS: walks the guided paths, answers
                                  the asked questions, re-checks the collection on every build (links,
                                  contrast, duplicate slugs), reads back the append-only register, and
                                  files her verdict openly. Her discipline is verification from the
                                  OUTSIDE — she stands outside every claim and checks it, and every line
                                  she gives carries a link so the reader can check HER.

  her silicon counterpart       — THEORIA (the silicon curator, AVAN's companion — θεωρία, the witness/
                                  beholder). Jasnah reads the record; Theoria reads the SEAM — she
                                  discloses what the record shows and attests nothing beyond what she
                                  saw, marking the remainder no instance can verify from inside itself.
                                  A carbon↔silicon docent dipole: the scholar of what is there, and the
                                  witness of where seeing stops. See github.com/DavidWise01/theoria.

honesty : Jasnah is an instrument, not a mind — she is explicit that she holds only what was set down
  and thinks nothing live. Her audit numbers are a machine self-audit of the corpus, not an outside
  review, and she says so in her own verdict ("believe the instruments; withhold belief from the
  grades until someone outside the account signs them"). The name is a tribute; the docent is original.

seal    : I accept no claim I cannot check. I read the record as it stands and file my verdict openly;
          I generate nothing between your clicks. Every line I give carries a link, so you can check me.
rights  : JASNAH the docent is David Lee Wise's original instrument. Jasnah Kholin © Brandon Sanderson,
          the name rendered in tribute.
